WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.020 --> 00:01.530
[Disclaimer: All events depicted in this series are fictional]

3
00:01.550 --> 00:02.390
[and created for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:02.420 --> 00:03.370
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

5
00:21.090 --> 00:23.000
I need some time to clear my head.

6
00:23.130 --> 00:24.400
Don't try to contact me.

7
00:25.370 --> 00:27.970
Thinking things might never be the same for the four of us

8
00:27.990 --> 00:29.270
breaks my heart.

9
00:29.410 --> 00:31.940
I can't ask you to forgive him.

10
00:31.970 --> 00:33.020
But at the very least,

11
00:33.120 --> 00:34.280
if something's come between you,

12
00:34.310 --> 00:36.220
try to talk things out first.

13
00:36.310 --> 00:39.640
If you don't talk to him, you might lose him.

14
00:40.130 --> 00:42.020
I'm here at the orchard to apologize to you.

15
00:42.050 --> 00:42.830
[Grandpa Phaew's Durian Orchard]

16
00:43.270 --> 00:44.620
Jet, please don't break up with me.

17
00:44.890 --> 00:47.250
I love you so much. There's no way we're breaking up.

18
00:48.970 --> 00:50.450
Will you marry me, Charn?

19
00:50.770 --> 00:53.000
I'm not letting you go again, either.

20
01:06.900 --> 01:10.990
Today, on behalf of Jet's family,

21
01:11.740 --> 01:13.780
bearing wishes of prosperity

22
01:15.789 --> 01:17.460
and enduring joy,

23
01:18.440 --> 01:21.680
along with the dowry,

24
01:22.210 --> 01:24.740
I ask for your son's hand.

25
01:31.560 --> 01:33.130
Mom,

26
01:33.830 --> 01:36.509
I'd like to get engaged to Charn for now.

27
01:37.700 --> 01:38.789
I promise...

28
01:39.430 --> 01:40.979
to make him happy.

29
01:47.320 --> 01:49.200
Once everything falls into place,

30
01:49.990 --> 01:51.560
we'll definitely get married.

31
01:57.870 --> 02:00.240
Even if I have to wait for more branches to open,

32
02:01.560 --> 02:02.610
I'll wait.

33
02:13.390 --> 02:15.090
Honestly, there's no need

34
02:15.110 --> 02:17.570
for all these formalities.

35
02:18.220 --> 02:20.350
All you had to do was ask me.

36
02:20.380 --> 02:23.640
I would've handed him over on a silver platter.

37
02:25.740 --> 02:26.820
Come on, Mom.

38
02:26.840 --> 02:28.060
What do you mean, "on a silver platter"?

39
02:30.329 --> 02:32.420
Anyway, the two of you are now...

40
02:32.700 --> 02:35.800
officially engaged.

41
02:39.020 --> 02:41.570
Why don't we take a photo together?

42
02:41.600 --> 02:44.930
Alright, photographers. Please take some nice shots.

43
02:46.690 --> 02:50.250
♪ The one who makes my dreams come true ♪

44
02:50.280 --> 02:51.910
Can you do this, too?

45
02:52.660 --> 02:55.860
- Are you sure? - Yeah, I don't mind at all.

46
02:56.150 --> 02:57.810
Can you do that, son?

47
02:57.829 --> 02:58.770
Is it really okay?

48
02:58.800 --> 02:59.680
Come on.

49
02:59.710 --> 03:00.330
Kiss his cheek.

50
03:00.350 --> 03:03.450
Kiss him. Kiss him.

51
03:08.240 --> 03:10.000
- Did you catch that? - Yes.

52
03:10.100 --> 03:11.960
If not, take another one.

53
03:11.980 --> 03:13.630
- Mom! - We need to get that shot.

54
03:13.660 --> 03:15.300
If they missed it, you need to do it again.

55
03:15.320 --> 03:18.050
Otherwise, we won't have a good keepsake.

56
03:21.730 --> 03:27.890
♪ A blessed day has come, with fortune aglow ♪

57
03:27.910 --> 03:33.990
♪ Graceful offerings are arranged in a row ♪

58
03:34.010 --> 03:38.200
♪ Sacred threads and rings of gold, ♪

59
03:38.230 --> 03:41.180
♪ Jewels and necklaces, precious to behold ♪

60
03:41.200 --> 03:43.310
♪ A feast overflowing with plenty to spare ♪

61
03:43.329 --> 03:46.250
♪ All things prepared with the greatest care ♪

62
03:46.270 --> 03:48.730
♪ Betel rolls and areca nuts are laid there ♪

63
03:48.750 --> 03:51.770
♪ Everything adorned and displayed with flair ♪

64
03:51.800 --> 03:57.740
♪ "May your vital forces come forth" ♪

65
03:57.760 --> 04:01.950
♪ May your vital forces come forth ♪

66
04:02.580 --> 04:06.220
♪ O vital forces, beyond the skies, ♪

67
04:06.250 --> 04:08.460
♪ In distant realms where your souls fly, ♪

68
04:08.480 --> 04:10.280
♪ Heed the call and now arise, ♪

69
04:10.300 --> 04:17.110
♪ Return to where your vessels lie ♪

70
05:02.880 --> 05:04.120
Turns out

71
05:04.310 --> 05:06.730
Ms. Ya has two reasons to celebrate today.

72
05:07.640 --> 05:10.030
Thank you for honoring us with your presence

73
05:10.060 --> 05:13.050
and for taking the time to join us today.

74
05:13.240 --> 05:16.330
Today is truly one of my proudest moments.

75
05:16.350 --> 05:22.190
The hotel we poured our hearts and souls into

76
05:22.220 --> 05:24.600
isn't just a single success story.

77
05:24.800 --> 05:26.840
We have our second location right here,

78
05:26.870 --> 05:29.130
where all of you are standing today.

79
05:29.160 --> 05:32.730
This property could never have succeeded

80
05:32.950 --> 05:35.070
without the help of...

81
05:35.360 --> 05:38.020
my talented son, Charn.

82
05:38.050 --> 05:39.909
A round of applause for him, please.

83
05:45.260 --> 05:48.190
And today,

84
05:48.450 --> 05:52.150
CKP Group isn't stopping here.

85
05:52.170 --> 05:54.540
Within the next two years,

86
05:55.010 --> 05:58.260
we will launch even more properties,

87
05:58.659 --> 06:00.200
and one of them is...

88
06:03.440 --> 06:06.050
CKP Villa Huahin!

89
06:13.570 --> 06:15.360
- And the other one is... - That looks fantastic.

90
06:15.450 --> 06:18.940
CKP Ville Monjam!

91
06:23.540 --> 06:26.660
I want to tell you that today's good news

92
06:26.680 --> 06:28.610
doesn't stop there.

93
06:28.940 --> 06:33.330
We also have a major project and a big surprise

94
06:33.350 --> 06:35.480
for all of you today.

95
06:39.540 --> 06:41.640
This major project is

96
06:41.659 --> 06:43.010
Charn Ubol,

97
06:43.130 --> 06:47.180
a new concept hotel in Ubon Ratchathani.

98
06:50.390 --> 06:54.200
It will be fully operated and managed

99
06:54.230 --> 06:57.990
by my beloved son, Charn.

100
06:58.060 --> 07:00.270
A round of applause, please.

101
07:02.040 --> 07:02.810
Charn.

102
07:03.230 --> 07:04.810
Did you know about this?

103
07:05.810 --> 07:06.750
I had no idea.

104
07:07.820 --> 07:10.100
This morning, my son officially became

105
07:10.450 --> 07:12.580
the son-in-law of a family from there.

106
07:13.170 --> 07:16.800
So I wanted to present this special gift

107
07:16.830 --> 07:19.860
to my dearest son.

108
07:19.890 --> 07:21.820
Please give Charn your support

109
07:21.840 --> 07:24.710
and keep him close to your hearts.

110
07:24.730 --> 07:26.690
Thank you very much.

111
07:28.040 --> 07:30.400
He's as amazing as his mom.

112
07:30.630 --> 07:31.510
He's incredible.

113
07:39.510 --> 07:40.520
Mom,

114
07:40.970 --> 07:41.920
were you serious?

115
07:42.630 --> 07:44.190
You really want me to run it?

116
07:44.740 --> 07:45.820
Charn,

117
07:46.110 --> 07:47.350
you're doing so well.

118
07:47.760 --> 07:50.659
You've helped me so much there's nothing left for me to teach you.

119
07:53.610 --> 07:58.270
Besides, don't you have someone special to take care of?

120
08:04.380 --> 08:05.180
Jet,

121
08:06.290 --> 08:08.380
I'm entrusting Charn to you.

122
08:12.950 --> 08:15.910
Please take good care of my wonderful son.

123
08:16.740 --> 08:18.230
Don't ever leave him.

124
08:24.240 --> 08:26.050
Mom...

125
08:28.710 --> 08:29.800
Jet,

126
08:30.400 --> 08:32.429
shouldn't I be the one getting emotional?

127
08:33.250 --> 08:34.500
Mom...

128
08:39.240 --> 08:40.440
I love you.

129
08:41.190 --> 08:42.909
Both of you.

130
08:52.140 --> 08:53.140
Thank you.

131
09:00.480 --> 09:02.900
It's been so long since I last got to enjoy the view of Bangkok.

132
09:19.140 --> 09:20.190
Peem...

133
09:22.290 --> 09:23.010
Listen.

134
09:31.340 --> 09:32.550
Tonight,

135
09:33.660 --> 09:35.020
I'm going out again.

136
09:39.620 --> 09:40.850
Can't you stay?

137
09:44.190 --> 09:45.190
I can't.

138
09:46.850 --> 09:49.660
I promised Jet and Charn a farewell night out,

139
09:52.000 --> 09:53.030
and besides,

140
09:54.050 --> 09:56.340
Kachen already booked a table for us.

141
09:58.340 --> 09:59.290
You can...

142
10:00.080 --> 10:01.490
find something to pass the time.

143
10:04.950 --> 10:06.820
What would I even do?

144
10:11.140 --> 10:13.950
[Buddhawajana: Sādayāy Dhamma]

145
10:19.200 --> 10:20.710
Take good care of yourself,

146
10:21.540 --> 10:23.030
and come back soon.

147
10:27.100 --> 10:28.100
I promise I will.

148
10:40.990 --> 10:42.150
Peem!

149
10:52.660 --> 10:53.920
Go take a shower now.

150
11:07.860 --> 11:09.130
You're just going to see Kachen for a bit

151
11:09.160 --> 11:10.970
and come right back, right, babe?

152
11:24.820 --> 11:25.680
What are you looking at?

153
11:26.270 --> 11:27.180
Is it too revealing?

154
11:41.000 --> 11:41.900
No.

155
11:43.010 --> 11:44.960
You're wearing something over it anyway, right?

156
11:46.800 --> 11:47.920
I'm not.

157
11:48.460 --> 11:50.490
Been in a suit all day. It's uncomfortable.

158
11:57.120 --> 11:59.100
Your body, your choice, of course.

159
12:00.070 --> 12:02.820
Wear whatever you like.

160
12:04.660 --> 12:06.130
I dressed up for you.

161
12:07.420 --> 12:08.320
Do you like it?

162
12:17.630 --> 12:19.430
I'm not used to seeing you like this,

163
12:20.570 --> 12:21.950
but if you want to...

164
12:21.990 --> 12:22.990
Be honest with me.

165
12:25.360 --> 12:26.340
Do you like it?

166
12:30.610 --> 12:32.170
If I'm being honest...

167
12:38.810 --> 12:40.150
Not really.

168
12:46.200 --> 12:47.500
If you don't like it,

169
12:49.160 --> 12:50.160
take it off, then.

170
14:36.970 --> 14:39.120
I booked a VVIP table for you.

171
14:39.140 --> 14:40.750
When you get there, tell them it's under Kachen.

172
14:40.770 --> 14:41.520
Khem...

173
14:45.530 --> 14:47.310
How do you turn on the shower?

174
15:13.160 --> 15:14.160
What is it?

175
15:21.190 --> 15:22.900
It looks like deer antlers.

176
15:29.770 --> 15:30.580
Khem...

177
15:34.760 --> 15:35.560
Yes?

178
15:37.200 --> 15:38.820
Do you want to ride a deer?

179
19:42.050 --> 19:43.010
Don't stop.

180
22:00.110 --> 22:00.990
Jet...

181
22:01.470 --> 22:02.880
Where are my glasses?

182
22:03.330 --> 22:04.910
Where did you put them?

183
22:05.200 --> 22:06.250
Find them.

184
22:08.610 --> 22:09.740
Are they here?

185
22:14.400 --> 22:15.520
Or here?

186
22:19.600 --> 22:20.690
Maybe right here?

187
22:21.650 --> 22:22.720
Or here?

188
22:24.220 --> 22:25.230
Right here?

189
22:34.310 --> 22:36.540
[Mom's Secretary]

190
22:38.000 --> 22:38.980
Who is it?

191
22:39.810 --> 22:41.170
Your mom's secretary.

192
22:43.100 --> 22:44.530
Is something going on at the hotel?

193
22:58.680 --> 22:59.720
Let it ring.

194
23:00.630 --> 23:02.640
It's not often I get free time like this.

195
23:03.900 --> 23:07.130
I want to spend it with my fiancé...

196
23:07.630 --> 23:08.990
and make every second count.

197
23:25.860 --> 23:33.380
[Kachen]

198
23:59.230 --> 24:00.730
Your friends aren't here yet, sir?

199
24:01.650 --> 24:04.130
Care to join the ladies across the way?

200
24:04.480 --> 24:06.580
They've been asking about you.

201
25:02.880 --> 25:03.850
Good evening.

202
25:03.880 --> 25:05.640
Do you have a reservation, sir?

203
25:06.710 --> 25:08.780
Yes, under Aiyara.

204
25:08.910 --> 25:10.940
I see. Right this way to the second floor.

205
25:15.820 --> 25:18.970
- Thank you. - We got such a great table.

206
25:19.000 --> 25:20.540
- Look. - It's in the perfect spot.

207
25:23.900 --> 25:25.320
- We don't need that now. - Right.

208
25:25.340 --> 25:25.960
- Hey. - Oh.

209
25:25.990 --> 25:26.760
- Hey, Ai. - Ai!

210
25:26.790 --> 25:28.220
- Ai! - You're finally here.

211
25:28.240 --> 25:30.980
Gosh, you're so late. Talk about punctuality.

212
25:31.000 --> 25:32.320
- Why not just show up tomorrow? - Have a seat.

213
25:34.380 --> 25:35.540
Now have a seat.

214
25:42.970 --> 25:45.850
- Oh, come on! You're late enough as it is. - Yeah, grab a seat.

215
25:46.200 --> 25:47.240
Hurry.

216
25:54.150 --> 25:56.440
Look at him, late and still being extra.

217
25:56.460 --> 25:58.230
- Always dragging your feet. - Always late.

218
26:05.430 --> 26:07.110
Since you're going back to your hometown,

219
26:07.230 --> 26:08.760
we wanted to go all out.

220
26:09.430 --> 26:10.800
And this place

221
26:10.930 --> 26:13.380
is insanely hard to book.

222
26:13.490 --> 26:15.340
Our manager here held the table for us.

223
26:15.580 --> 26:17.060
You should thank him.

224
26:20.690 --> 26:21.660
Thank you very much.

225
26:21.680 --> 26:22.900
Hey, it's nothing.

226
26:24.080 --> 26:25.550
No need to be so formal with me, Ai.

227
26:26.490 --> 26:27.970
Don't act like we're strangers.

228
26:29.500 --> 26:30.910
Still...

229
26:31.870 --> 26:34.930
you shouldn't have gone to all this trouble.

230
26:35.810 --> 26:38.290
Anyway, thank you...

231
26:39.640 --> 26:41.140
for getting us a table.

232
26:45.130 --> 26:45.950
Come on.

233
26:46.560 --> 26:48.650
Let's start drinking to set the mood.

234
26:49.180 --> 26:50.580
- Sounds good. - Absolutely.

235
26:50.600 --> 26:51.350
- Cheers. - Cheers.

236
26:51.370 --> 26:53.830
Wait, what are you having today, Ai?

237
26:54.430 --> 26:55.630
Yeah, the usual?

238
26:55.950 --> 26:56.990
Well...

239
26:57.740 --> 27:00.220
I'll pass on drinking today.

240
27:00.250 --> 27:03.040
I have an early morning tomorrow.

241
27:04.120 --> 27:06.660
- Late and not drinking? - Seriously, not even a drop?

242
27:06.690 --> 27:07.930
What gives?

243
27:07.950 --> 27:08.950
We waited forever.

244
27:08.970 --> 27:11.400
- Come on, just drink with us. - I'll get you a special mocktail, then.

245
27:16.160 --> 27:17.180
Fia.

246
27:17.650 --> 27:18.470
Over here, Fia.

247
27:22.730 --> 27:25.990
Yeah, I'll probably be gone for a while.

248
27:31.020 --> 27:35.140
Thanks for coming, though.

249
27:37.190 --> 27:39.090
- Why were you so late? - Yeah.

250
27:39.110 --> 27:41.090
I had something to take care of.

251
27:42.600 --> 27:43.900
Grab some food.

252
27:44.640 --> 27:45.920
I had to stop by a few places.

253
27:46.010 --> 27:48.710
Figures. That's why you took forever.

254
27:48.790 --> 27:51.130
Stay with us so we can catch up properly.

255
27:51.320 --> 27:52.900
Eat something to get your energy up.

256
27:53.160 --> 27:54.050
Are you hungry?

257
27:54.850 --> 27:55.840
You guys go ahead.

258
27:56.070 --> 27:57.170
I already ate a little.

259
28:15.930 --> 28:17.070
They all ditched me, I guess.

260
28:17.280 --> 28:19.090
Oh, he's my boyfriend.

261
28:19.260 --> 28:20.890
He always goes limp when he's drunk.

262
28:33.700 --> 28:34.370
Hey!

263
28:37.860 --> 28:39.850
Who the hell are you? Why did you punch me?

264
28:39.870 --> 28:41.210
What the hell are you doing?

265
28:41.330 --> 28:42.430
He's my boyfriend.

266
28:42.630 --> 28:43.850
I'm taking him home.

267
28:43.880 --> 28:45.110
What the fuck are you butting in for?

268
28:47.220 --> 28:48.160
Trying to be a white knight?

269
28:50.190 --> 28:51.310
Where do you get off playing the hero?

270
28:55.360 --> 28:56.070
Hey.

271
28:59.540 --> 29:01.310
Hey, are you alright?

272
29:02.570 --> 29:03.380
You bastard!

273
29:08.630 --> 29:09.820
You son of a...

274
29:14.330 --> 29:15.460
Are you okay, sir?

275
29:16.270 --> 29:16.820
Blood...

276
29:16.840 --> 29:17.520
A knife...

277
29:18.210 --> 29:19.740
- A knife, blood... - Blood!

278
29:20.540 --> 29:21.310
Manager!

279
29:21.330 --> 29:22.560
- Call 1669! Call emergency! - Ai!

280
29:22.580 --> 29:23.710
Give me your phone.

281
29:23.740 --> 29:25.090
Call the police.

282
29:25.410 --> 29:26.540
Are you okay?

283
29:26.890 --> 29:28.120
Stay calm.

284
29:28.220 --> 29:29.660
Stay calm. Don't panic.

285
29:29.680 --> 29:31.510
I have to call the police.

286
29:35.710 --> 29:37.280
Call the police!

287
29:40.540 --> 29:41.400
Stay calm.

288
29:41.530 --> 29:42.620
Don't panic.

289
29:52.800 --> 29:54.720
Kachen...

290
29:58.030 --> 29:59.250
Easy, Jet.

291
29:59.530 --> 30:02.380
I thought you weren't going to make it.

292
30:02.960 --> 30:04.770
Are you wishing me well or wishing me dead?

293
30:05.260 --> 30:08.330
I had to make it to MC your wedding.

294
30:11.980 --> 30:13.210
What did the doctor say?

295
30:15.640 --> 30:17.350
My abs were too solid.

296
30:17.430 --> 30:18.680
The blade couldn't get through.

297
30:20.410 --> 30:22.690
Come on, Kachen.

298
30:22.990 --> 30:26.430
If you're still cracking jokes like this,

299
30:28.330 --> 30:31.250
I guess you are going to be fine.

300
30:31.650 --> 30:32.920
Just a flesh wound.

301
30:33.690 --> 30:35.470
I'll be back on the prowl in a few days.

302
30:36.190 --> 30:38.180
I'm still mad at you guys, though.

303
30:38.550 --> 30:40.660
Why did you stand me up?

304
31:08.360 --> 31:09.760
I'm craving fried chicken and beer.

305
31:09.930 --> 31:11.260
Get me some as an apology.

306
31:12.740 --> 31:15.210
It's so late. Where are we supposed to get them?

307
31:15.390 --> 31:18.290
I don't care. Charn and Jet, you go get them.

308
31:20.680 --> 31:22.010
You should go with them, Khem.

309
31:22.270 --> 31:24.430
I want to have some time with Kachen.

310
31:34.200 --> 31:35.000
Okay.

311
31:35.430 --> 31:36.010
Come on.

312
31:36.780 --> 31:37.520
Alright.

313
31:40.320 --> 31:41.410
We'll be right back.

314
31:57.660 --> 31:58.370
Go on.

315
31:59.920 --> 32:01.410
Say whatever you want to say.

316
32:06.110 --> 32:08.790
Remember what Monk Kasem warned us about?

317
32:10.850 --> 32:13.060
Take good care of yourself.

318
32:13.740 --> 32:15.550
I see the shadow of ill fortune hanging over you.

319
32:16.320 --> 32:18.070
Especially in the coming year.

320
32:19.850 --> 32:21.400
I thought it had passed,

321
32:23.950 --> 32:25.740
but it seems mine hasn't.

322
32:33.050 --> 32:34.950
You read my fortune, didn't you?

323
32:40.280 --> 32:41.390
Tell me.

324
32:43.550 --> 32:45.160
My time is up, isn't it?

325
32:46.610 --> 32:47.480
No.

326
32:50.060 --> 32:51.290
Your fate...

327
32:52.070 --> 32:54.430
keeps shifting back and forth.

328
32:56.310 --> 32:58.210
I'll try tracing it.

329
32:59.510 --> 33:01.450
There might be an answer

330
33:03.310 --> 33:05.720
as to why your fate has been this way.

331
33:21.410 --> 33:22.120
Ai...

332
33:42.510 --> 33:43.290
Who is it?

333
33:46.050 --> 33:47.200
Do you know him?

334
34:04.720 --> 34:05.930
I told you, babe.

335
34:06.240 --> 34:09.060
It's past the legal time to buy beer.

336
34:09.230 --> 34:11.130
Nobody would sell it to us.

337
34:18.659 --> 34:22.870
Fried chicken is here. Still nice and warm.

338
34:28.210 --> 34:28.810
Whoa.

339
34:29.610 --> 34:30.420
Are you hot?

340
34:32.389 --> 34:34.460
Yeah, crank up the AC.

341
34:36.420 --> 34:40.190
Whoa, I'm already shivering here.

342
34:47.510 --> 34:49.659
Perhaps... you have a fever?

343
34:51.870 --> 34:52.659
A fever?

344
34:55.300 --> 34:56.360
You feel warm.

345
34:56.800 --> 34:57.590
A bit warm.

346
34:57.620 --> 34:59.400
Whoa, you're running a low fever.

347
35:02.560 --> 35:04.110
- Let me check your pulse. - Why?

348
35:05.550 --> 35:07.020
- You're still alive. - Oh, yeah?

349
35:07.370 --> 35:08.820
Can I check your pulse?

350
35:09.210 --> 35:10.400
- Okay. - Is he okay?

351
35:12.140 --> 35:13.500
I can tell, you know.

352
35:17.080 --> 35:18.530
What were you two up to just now?

353
35:21.900 --> 35:23.030
I was just...

354
35:25.250 --> 35:26.890
using holy water to wash away his bad luck.

355
35:27.520 --> 35:28.660
And...

356
35:31.120 --> 35:32.300
And?

357
35:39.790 --> 35:42.210
I'll tell you when we get home.

358
35:55.550 --> 35:56.420
Good, right?

359
36:03.330 --> 36:05.340
"Aiyara Chaithong."

360
36:06.970 --> 36:08.150
The company said

361
36:08.180 --> 36:10.620
he quit on the day you ran into him at the bar.

362
36:11.290 --> 36:14.940
Apparently, he's going to help his family out at home in Surin, sir.

363
36:17.360 --> 36:18.300
Has he left yet?

364
36:18.390 --> 36:19.400
He left yesterday, sir.

365
36:20.990 --> 36:24.290
Would you like me to go there and dig deeper?

366
36:25.020 --> 36:25.960
No need.

367
36:29.260 --> 36:30.150
I'll go there myself.

368
36:32.360 --> 36:35.330
His fate is as turbulent as yours.

369
36:40.570 --> 36:43.040
And both of your fates...

370
36:46.600 --> 36:48.110
are bound together.

371
36:53.750 --> 36:56.860
[Seven years later]

372
36:56.880 --> 36:58.340
And then what happened?

373
36:58.470 --> 37:02.500
Where did you finally find Uncle Ai?

374
37:03.520 --> 37:06.160
At the elephant camp, his home.

375
37:06.400 --> 37:08.390
Does your family raise elephants, Uncle Ai?

376
37:08.500 --> 37:11.070
I want to ride an elephant. Can you take me?

377
37:12.180 --> 37:14.880
Then you have to ask your daddy first.

378
37:16.050 --> 37:17.470
And what happened next?

379
37:17.750 --> 37:21.320
How did you end up in love with Uncle Ai?

380
37:21.410 --> 37:22.710
I'm curious.

381
37:23.550 --> 37:24.420
Aha.

382
37:24.950 --> 37:26.360
Enjoying my story, are you?

383
37:28.130 --> 37:30.280
It's a long story if I keep going.

384
37:32.050 --> 37:33.340
Definitely long.

385
37:33.990 --> 37:37.340
He's full of hot air, always making things up.

386
37:38.110 --> 37:41.210
Hey, I'm not making things up.

387
37:41.580 --> 37:45.940
I've been through countless battles and crazy adventures.

388
37:46.160 --> 37:48.340
More action-packed than your dad's life.

389
37:49.060 --> 37:51.290
All that just to win Uncle Ai's heart.

390
37:52.910 --> 37:54.440
More action-packed than my dad's life?

391
37:54.690 --> 37:56.280
Since when did my dad get into fights?

392
37:59.330 --> 38:01.170
Don't get me started.

393
38:02.170 --> 38:03.470
Your dad...

394
38:03.640 --> 38:05.330
What are you telling them, Kachen?

395
38:05.820 --> 38:07.210
Nothing.

396
38:09.780 --> 38:10.520
Oh?

397
38:11.700 --> 38:14.020
You've been busy chatting. Still not done eating?

398
38:14.540 --> 38:15.930
You won't have time to change your outfits.

399
38:16.460 --> 38:18.770
Well, it's bland, Daddy.

400
38:21.500 --> 38:22.580
Add some of this, then.

401
38:42.510 --> 38:43.570
Better?

402
38:43.780 --> 38:44.560
Yeah.

403
38:46.210 --> 38:47.480
Eat up, then.

404
38:47.780 --> 38:50.450
Your dad and Uncle Charn's procession will be here soon.

405
38:51.920 --> 38:52.600
Wait,

406
38:52.720 --> 38:56.600
I heard Uncle Jet proposed to Uncle Charn, right?

407
38:57.400 --> 39:02.220
Then why is Uncle Charn leading the procession to ask for Uncle Jet's hand?

408
39:03.370 --> 39:05.880
Jet wanted a little moment to be the pretty one

409
39:06.570 --> 39:08.770
and let Charn fuss over him.

410
39:15.090 --> 39:16.390
In the end,

411
39:16.570 --> 39:20.580
it's about two people choosing to be together.

412
39:20.670 --> 39:22.230
As for the ceremony,

413
39:22.750 --> 39:24.380
it's whatever makes them comfortable.

414
39:28.430 --> 39:29.350
Keep eating.

415
39:39.910 --> 39:42.290
How's that for my secret weapon?

416
39:42.370 --> 39:43.730
Cleaned the whole bowl, huh?

417
39:44.330 --> 39:46.150
Come on, it's time to get changed.

418
39:49.620 --> 39:50.650
Come on.

419
39:51.440 --> 39:52.030
Off you go.

420
39:54.340 --> 39:55.950
- Say hello to them. - Hello.

421
39:55.980 --> 39:56.950
- Hello. - Hello.

422
39:58.810 --> 39:59.730
Aren't they adorable?

423
40:00.470 --> 40:01.850
Makes me want some of my own.

424
40:01.960 --> 40:03.670
I want to have kids.

425
40:05.890 --> 40:07.830
Make sure you can take care of yourself first.

426
40:09.790 --> 40:11.780
Can I count on you for that?

427
40:14.940 --> 40:25.030
[Nakarnkoon Orchard]

428
40:29.990 --> 40:32.230
Envelopes before entry, please.

429
40:32.910 --> 40:34.740
Of course. Here.

430
40:36.330 --> 40:38.480
- Thank you. - Please let us through.

431
40:38.730 --> 40:40.380
- Thank you. - Thank you.

432
40:41.850 --> 40:43.020
So, what do we do now?

433
40:43.040 --> 40:45.020
Charn, hey.

434
40:45.420 --> 40:46.700
Is this all you're giving?

435
40:46.720 --> 40:48.520
Master Paran gave us way more than this.

436
40:50.880 --> 40:53.070
Fine, one more envelope. Here.

437
40:55.020 --> 40:56.190
- Thank you. - Thank you.

438
40:56.220 --> 40:58.800
Let me save some for the other gates.

439
40:59.430 --> 41:01.880
- Thank you. - Thank you.

440
41:24.780 --> 41:26.910
You two are looking so cool today.

441
41:31.810 --> 41:34.090
- Please wash your feet - Please wash your feet

442
41:34.110 --> 41:36.640
- before asking for the groom's hand. - before asking for the groom's hand.

443
42:14.090 --> 42:16.170
The groom has arrived.

444
42:19.130 --> 42:20.500
Hi.

445
42:20.930 --> 42:23.030
- Hello. - Hello.

446
42:50.550 --> 42:51.860
God, Jet.

447
42:51.960 --> 42:54.420
You couldn't wait just a little longer, could you?

448
43:05.210 --> 43:06.910
- Jet! - Jet!

449
43:07.610 --> 43:08.670
Uncle Jet!

450
43:16.230 --> 43:17.950
You rascals, here to congratulate me, too?

451
43:22.110 --> 43:24.990
- Why are you calling us that? - Why are you calling us that?

452
43:39.540 --> 43:43.150
- Take that! - Take that, Jet!

453
43:44.250 --> 43:45.120
- Take that! - Take that!

454
43:52.060 --> 43:53.460
They're Master's kuman thongs.

455
43:55.200 --> 43:56.180
Don't be scared.

456
44:00.990 --> 44:02.220
I can feel it.

457
44:03.270 --> 44:05.520
Judging from Jet's laughter,

458
44:06.020 --> 44:07.670
they must be really adorable.

459
44:07.690 --> 44:08.780
Take that!

460
44:09.090 --> 44:10.500
- Take that. - Hey.

461
44:10.780 --> 44:11.880
That tickles.

462
44:21.630 --> 44:23.850
They're just like Thong and Ake, aren't they?

463
44:31.770 --> 44:32.900
I'm really sorry.

464
44:34.760 --> 44:37.720
They insisted on wearing these outfits.

465
44:39.490 --> 44:40.570
It's totally fine.

466
44:40.720 --> 44:41.650
It's actually wonderful.

467
44:41.980 --> 44:43.010
Truly wonderful.

468
44:51.560 --> 44:52.860
I finally get to see them.

469
45:00.370 --> 45:02.650
So this is what Thong and Ake looked like.

470
45:26.190 --> 45:27.290
Jet, Charn...

471
45:28.240 --> 45:29.910
Stop crying.

472
45:30.690 --> 45:32.510
You won't look good in the photos.

473
45:34.330 --> 45:36.080
Look who's talking.

474
46:52.820 --> 46:55.790
When are you going to ask for Uncle Jet's hand?

475
47:05.200 --> 47:06.700
There's an octopus, too!

476
47:12.110 --> 47:13.110
Cute little octopus.

477
47:13.830 --> 47:14.930
Guys,

478
47:15.760 --> 47:17.330
please keep it down.

479
47:18.360 --> 47:20.270
Let your dad rest, okay?

480
47:25.710 --> 47:28.030
Why don't you two take a nap, too?

481
47:28.930 --> 47:30.380
So you'll have energy for tonight.

482
47:30.590 --> 47:34.200
Don't worry, Daddy. We've got plenty of energy left.

483
47:34.310 --> 47:39.720
Oh, please. You're always dozing off at dinner.

484
47:40.850 --> 47:42.680
Come on, time to change.

485
47:48.630 --> 47:50.360
Here you go, your pajamas.

486
47:56.580 --> 47:57.990
Something on your mind, Singha?

487
48:01.010 --> 48:03.600
You never told us

488
48:03.850 --> 48:07.020
how you found Suea and me.

489
48:08.720 --> 48:11.540
What? I already told you

490
48:11.820 --> 48:14.590
that we adopted you two from a foster home.

491
48:16.100 --> 48:17.900
Then why did the uncles say

492
48:17.930 --> 48:21.100
we were Dad's assistants in our past lives?

493
48:21.580 --> 48:24.260
How did you and Dad find out

494
48:24.280 --> 48:26.160
where we were in this life?

495
48:30.820 --> 48:31.730
Well...

496
48:33.220 --> 48:36.000
I didn't want either of you

497
48:36.670 --> 48:38.650
dwelling on who you used to be.

498
48:40.450 --> 48:42.440
We love you

499
48:43.490 --> 48:45.830
for who you are right now, as Suea and Singha.

500
48:48.140 --> 48:49.110
I know,

501
48:49.130 --> 48:51.250
but I want to know about that, too.

502
48:52.810 --> 48:54.270
I want to know, too!

503
48:54.680 --> 48:57.860
Uncle Jet was crying so much today

504
48:58.110 --> 49:00.330
when he saw us in those outfits.

505
49:15.450 --> 49:18.580
We didn't look for you two.

506
49:20.270 --> 49:22.570
It was you who found your way back to us.

507
49:52.530 --> 49:54.610
Are the snacks ready, Prof. Khem?

508
49:54.680 --> 49:57.110
Yes, you can take these two trays.

509
49:58.300 --> 49:59.220
Whoa.

510
49:59.250 --> 50:00.790
These look delicious.

511
50:00.820 --> 50:02.540
The kids are going to love them.

512
50:11.480 --> 50:12.960
Here they come.

513
50:15.930 --> 50:17.590
Are these fish cakes?

514
50:17.720 --> 50:19.920
Yes, they're fish cakes.

515
50:20.630 --> 50:21.570
Try some.

516
50:30.530 --> 50:32.780
- It's yummy! - Yay.

517
50:33.150 --> 50:34.190
Help yourselves.

518
50:34.700 --> 50:35.920
Take as much as you'd like.

519
50:49.480 --> 50:50.420
Thank you.

520
50:54.210 --> 50:55.810
The kids are so sweet.

521
50:58.550 --> 50:59.260
They are.

522
51:11.890 --> 51:12.940
Thank you

523
51:14.360 --> 51:16.640
for bringing me here to celebrate our anniversary.

524
51:32.030 --> 51:33.540
Buddho, calm the mind.

525
51:33.570 --> 51:34.740
Dhammo, touch the heart inside.

526
51:34.770 --> 51:36.180
Sangho, let love abide.

527
51:36.730 --> 51:38.100
Mana, let kindness reside.

528
51:48.200 --> 51:49.070
Peem...

529
51:50.440 --> 51:51.980
The snack is already delicious.

530
51:52.360 --> 51:54.660
Did you have to chant over it?

531
51:56.500 --> 51:58.130
Everything you make is delicious.

532
52:01.210 --> 52:02.720
I just think it'd be a shame

533
52:04.430 --> 52:06.530
if others never got to taste it.

534
52:09.470 --> 52:10.220
Well,

535
52:11.120 --> 52:12.020
here I am.

536
52:12.770 --> 52:14.810
I made enough for everyone, didn't I?

537
52:15.440 --> 52:16.830
Seeing the kids enjoy the snacks

538
52:17.070 --> 52:18.530
makes me so happy.

539
52:22.060 --> 52:23.040
I know,

540
52:25.110 --> 52:26.620
but wouldn't it be even better

541
52:27.040 --> 52:29.500
if we had kids waiting for us at home?

542
52:42.780 --> 52:44.440
What do you mean, Peem?

543
52:47.950 --> 52:49.360
Do you want to have kids?

544
53:20.770 --> 53:22.170
- Did you wait long? - Hi.

545
53:22.650 --> 53:23.390
Hey there.

546
53:24.100 --> 53:25.330
Where are you from?

547
53:30.300 --> 53:31.620
Look, Peem.

548
53:33.050 --> 53:34.670
- Peekaboo. - Looks like a mischievous one.

549
53:34.700 --> 53:35.640
Peekaboo.

550
53:35.670 --> 53:36.490
Here.

551
53:36.510 --> 53:37.590
So adorable.

552
53:45.630 --> 53:46.890
Oh, my.

553
53:48.010 --> 53:51.100
You've been on the move nonstop since you could walk.

554
53:51.180 --> 53:52.380
Hello, Master.

555
53:55.300 --> 53:56.180
Hey there.

556
54:05.550 --> 54:07.020
Get some snacks from Master.

557
54:27.190 --> 54:28.390
They're still so little.

558
54:30.370 --> 54:32.230
Aren't they supposed to be at daycare?

559
54:34.450 --> 54:36.140
They were rescued from an orphanage

560
54:36.170 --> 54:37.720
that caught fire.

561
54:38.570 --> 54:40.430
We still don't know what to do with them.

562
54:56.310 --> 54:57.400
Grandma Si...

563
55:14.180 --> 55:15.070
Peem...

564
55:20.090 --> 55:21.900
I'm ready to have children.

565
55:25.820 --> 55:26.930
Our children.

566
55:32.300 --> 55:33.230
Then we will.

567
55:34.980 --> 55:36.060
Our children.

568
55:49.560 --> 55:50.760
You're adorable.

569
55:54.240 --> 55:55.600
And ever since then,

570
55:55.840 --> 55:58.250
you two have been in our lives,

571
56:01.350 --> 56:04.190
bringing joy to us every single day.

572
57:29.090 --> 57:30.080
Thank you.

573
57:58.390 --> 58:02.630
♪ There once was someone I longed to find, ♪

574
58:02.650 --> 58:06.700
♪ I wondered how it'd feel to call them mine ♪

575
58:06.720 --> 58:13.800
♪ The love I dreamed of, yet never defined, ♪

576
58:14.340 --> 58:18.440
♪ Then you appeared, as if by design, ♪

577
58:18.470 --> 58:22.410
♪ And the dream took form beyond my mind ♪

578
59:08.320 --> 59:10.110
May I invite both grooms

579
59:10.390 --> 59:12.550
to exchange their rings.

580
59:33.560 --> 59:37.860
♪ The one who makes my dreams come true, ♪

581
59:37.890 --> 59:41.660
♪ The one in my heart, baby, it's you ♪

582
59:41.690 --> 59:46.400
♪ It's you I've been longing for, ♪

583
59:46.430 --> 59:50.250
♪ The one I've always adored ♪

584
59:50.720 --> 59:55.020
♪ Right by my side, it's truly you ♪

585
59:55.040 --> 59:58.770
♪ Clearly, my heart beats just for you ♪

586
59:58.790 --> 01:00:03.540
♪ It's you I want, nothing more ♪

587
01:00:03.570 --> 01:00:09.520
♪ From now on, you'll be my all ♪

588
01:00:14.210 --> 01:00:16.560
♪ The one who makes my dreams come true, ♪

589
01:00:16.580 --> 01:00:17.380
Kiss him.

590
01:00:17.400 --> 01:00:24.520
- Kiss him. Kiss him. - Kiss him. Kiss him.

591
01:00:27.030 --> 01:00:31.350
♪ The one I've always adored ♪

592
01:00:31.370 --> 01:00:35.650
♪ Right by my side, it's truly you ♪

593
01:00:35.670 --> 01:00:39.500
♪ Clearly, my heart beats just for you ♪

594
01:00:39.950 --> 01:00:41.680
You may now cut the cake.

595
01:00:44.160 --> 01:00:49.970
♪ From now on, you'll be my all ♪

596
01:00:58.690 --> 01:01:00.260
Can I have some cake?

597
01:01:00.290 --> 01:01:01.400
Can we have some cake?

598
01:01:01.430 --> 01:01:02.700
Wait just a little.

599
01:01:04.650 --> 01:01:06.140
Hey, Charn.

600
01:01:07.540 --> 01:01:09.880
I never thought

601
01:01:10.050 --> 01:01:12.980
anyone could ever handle my son.

602
01:01:13.100 --> 01:01:16.230
I'm leaving him in your hands forever.

603
01:01:16.550 --> 01:01:19.600
Under no circumstances are you allowed to return him.

604
01:01:21.510 --> 01:01:22.890
That's right.

605
01:01:23.430 --> 01:01:25.360
Don't you dare leave Jet, Charn.

606
01:01:25.580 --> 01:01:26.950
Or else I'll...

607
01:01:31.850 --> 01:01:33.180
Love...

608
01:01:33.610 --> 01:01:36.810
isn't always beautiful and easy.

609
01:01:37.010 --> 01:01:40.370
There will be times when you get upset.

610
01:01:40.780 --> 01:01:43.630
However, I don't want you two competing

611
01:01:43.650 --> 01:01:45.580
over who is more exhausted

612
01:01:45.610 --> 01:01:47.170
or who has it harder.

613
01:01:47.440 --> 01:01:49.010
I hope you both

614
01:01:49.030 --> 01:01:53.330
make your home a warm and safe place,

615
01:01:53.350 --> 01:01:54.310
somewhere you'll always

616
01:01:54.330 --> 01:01:57.790
want to return to every single day.

617
01:01:59.470 --> 01:02:01.570
I love you both so much.

618
01:02:31.790 --> 01:02:32.960
First of all,

619
01:02:34.070 --> 01:02:35.910
I'd like to thank Charn.

620
01:02:36.730 --> 01:02:38.630
Even though I'm only your master,

621
01:02:40.370 --> 01:02:42.060
you still gave me the honor

622
01:02:43.090 --> 01:02:46.210
of asking for Jet's hand on your behalf.

623
01:02:53.350 --> 01:02:54.630
They say

624
01:02:56.000 --> 01:02:57.850
it takes ups and downs,

625
01:02:59.560 --> 01:03:00.710
hardships,

626
01:03:01.910 --> 01:03:03.090
joys,

627
01:03:03.450 --> 01:03:05.350
challenges,

628
01:03:06.830 --> 01:03:09.470
and a whole lot of arguing

629
01:03:11.460 --> 01:03:12.900
to build a bond that makes love bloom.

630
01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:21.990
Charn,

631
01:03:23.130 --> 01:03:25.480
you've always had your head on straight,

632
01:03:27.690 --> 01:03:29.300
which is why I've never scolded you

633
01:03:30.160 --> 01:03:31.550
or given you an earful.

634
01:03:32.020 --> 01:03:33.340
But that doesn't mean

635
01:03:33.670 --> 01:03:35.570
the bond I have with you

636
01:03:36.150 --> 01:03:37.600
is any less than with anyone else.

637
01:03:38.660 --> 01:03:40.090
You're quite the opposite of Jet,

638
01:03:41.010 --> 01:03:42.350
who gives me a hard time every single day.

639
01:03:42.510 --> 01:03:43.260
What?

640
01:03:45.750 --> 01:03:47.060
Even so,

641
01:03:48.090 --> 01:03:49.580
as the old saying goes,

642
01:03:50.890 --> 01:03:53.450
"The more you scold, the deeper the bond."

643
01:03:54.300 --> 01:03:55.870
That's why...

644
01:03:56.550 --> 01:03:58.140
we are thrilled

645
01:03:59.720 --> 01:04:01.060
and deeply moved

646
01:04:02.830 --> 01:04:04.580
to see Jet this happy.

647
01:04:08.960 --> 01:04:10.840
I've known you since you were a teen, Jet.

648
01:04:14.400 --> 01:04:15.340
Today,

649
01:04:16.670 --> 01:04:18.290
it brings me so much joy

650
01:04:18.800 --> 01:04:20.620
to see you grown up,

651
01:04:21.520 --> 01:04:23.360
stepping into

652
01:04:24.520 --> 01:04:25.920
an important chapter of your life.

653
01:04:28.250 --> 01:04:29.250
Jet,

654
01:04:29.820 --> 01:04:30.960
Charn,

655
01:04:31.970 --> 01:04:34.160
I won't pray to any higher powers

656
01:04:35.100 --> 01:04:37.910
to make your love last forever

657
01:04:39.170 --> 01:04:40.360
because I know

658
01:04:41.070 --> 01:04:42.830
you can make that happen on your own.

659
01:04:46.500 --> 01:04:48.520
However, as your master,

660
01:04:49.390 --> 01:04:52.160
I will always protect you both.

661
01:05:53.550 --> 01:05:54.630
Khem,

662
01:05:54.660 --> 01:05:57.170
you haven't even said a word. Why are you crying?

663
01:06:08.100 --> 01:06:10.270
Khem once told me

664
01:06:11.230 --> 01:06:12.670
that I was the reason everyone smiles

665
01:06:13.630 --> 01:06:15.460
and the source of happiness for them.

666
01:06:17.400 --> 01:06:18.700
I used to wonder

667
01:06:19.520 --> 01:06:21.610
how I could make everyone happy.

668
01:06:24.180 --> 01:06:25.800
Yet looking around today...

669
01:06:33.590 --> 01:06:35.540
Everyone is happy because of our wedding.

670
01:06:36.970 --> 01:06:38.460
And do you know

671
01:06:39.600 --> 01:06:41.760
who the happiest person here is?

672
01:06:56.360 --> 01:06:57.640
They say

673
01:06:59.460 --> 01:07:02.450
when you feel connected to someone

674
01:07:03.220 --> 01:07:05.160
you've never met before,

675
01:07:07.830 --> 01:07:09.900
it means that in a past life,

676
01:07:10.840 --> 01:07:12.520
your paths were intertwined.

677
01:07:15.540 --> 01:07:18.070
Yet regardless of how your paths were intertwined,

678
01:07:21.520 --> 01:07:22.930
in my eyes,

679
01:07:23.560 --> 01:07:25.600
holding on to one another

680
01:07:26.940 --> 01:07:28.590
is what matters most.

681
01:07:31.790 --> 01:07:35.870
Ever since I met Jet and Charn...

682
01:07:37.470 --> 01:07:39.980
Ever since the two of them

683
01:07:41.480 --> 01:07:42.900
chose to be my friends,

684
01:07:43.930 --> 01:07:45.480
life hasn't gotten any easier

685
01:07:46.590 --> 01:07:48.300
for either of them,

686
01:07:51.830 --> 01:07:53.260
yet neither...

687
01:07:54.920 --> 01:07:56.810
ever gave up on me.

688
01:07:57.810 --> 01:07:58.910
I'm not letting you leave.

689
01:07:59.420 --> 01:08:00.700
But if you're really going,

690
01:08:00.990 --> 01:08:02.280
I'm coming with you.

691
01:08:03.090 --> 01:08:04.000
Count me in, too.

692
01:08:04.400 --> 01:08:06.280
Even though we only just met,

693
01:08:07.330 --> 01:08:09.590
you mean so much to us, Khem.

694
01:08:10.010 --> 01:08:11.590
There's nothing to be afraid of.

695
01:08:12.770 --> 01:08:14.390
All my friends are right here.

696
01:08:17.520 --> 01:08:18.630
They brought me

697
01:08:20.029 --> 01:08:21.990
to this moment,

698
01:08:22.890 --> 01:08:24.609
standing before you all.

699
01:08:34.279 --> 01:08:35.729
Thank you so much,

700
01:08:36.279 --> 01:08:37.390
Jet, Charn.

701
01:08:37.660 --> 01:08:41.310
♪ My love for you will never fade ♪

702
01:08:43.020 --> 01:08:43.960
I...

703
01:08:44.770 --> 01:08:48.130
♪ Can you feel the love my heart longs to show? ♪

704
01:08:50.069 --> 01:08:52.010
I love you so, so much.

705
01:08:54.300 --> 01:08:55.170
I really do.

706
01:08:55.550 --> 01:08:59.770
- We made it. - We made it.

707
01:09:02.210 --> 01:09:04.210
What happened today

708
01:09:05.279 --> 01:09:07.020
isn't just the happy ending

709
01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:10.240
to a story that's come to an end.

710
01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:12.800
Rather, it's the beginning

711
01:09:13.700 --> 01:09:16.550
of a whole new chapter for the two of you.

712
01:09:17.779 --> 01:09:19.529
Look at you getting all emotional.

713
01:09:21.250 --> 01:09:23.540
It feels like watching my own son

714
01:09:25.290 --> 01:09:27.460
finally settle down and start a family.

715
01:09:28.410 --> 01:09:30.899
We're stepping into another chapter of our lives.

716
01:09:31.109 --> 01:09:32.810
There will surely be moments of joy

717
01:09:32.939 --> 01:09:34.020
and sorrow

718
01:09:34.229 --> 01:09:35.830
along the way.

719
01:09:36.770 --> 01:09:37.979
But if...

720
01:09:39.100 --> 01:09:41.220
you ever want kids like Khem does,

721
01:09:42.439 --> 01:09:43.410
say the word.

722
01:09:45.080 --> 01:09:47.899
But what will get us through it all

723
01:09:47.970 --> 01:09:49.500
is never giving up

724
01:09:50.520 --> 01:09:52.149
and holding on to each other...

725
01:09:57.660 --> 01:09:59.460
just like we've always done.

726
01:09:59.570 --> 01:10:00.680
Love you.

727
01:10:01.270 --> 01:10:02.380
Love you.

728
01:10:02.400 --> 01:10:03.670
Love you so, so much.

729
01:10:30.580 --> 01:10:33.570
Hello, everyone.

730
01:10:33.790 --> 01:10:36.630
With the music pumping like this,

731
01:10:36.650 --> 01:10:38.980
let's have some fun.

732
01:10:45.990 --> 01:10:47.390
Come join the fun, everybody.

733
01:10:49.330 --> 01:10:51.570
Enjoy yourselves.

734
01:10:52.500 --> 01:10:54.700
- Dad, come on. - Hurry up.

735
01:10:57.540 --> 01:10:59.460
Come dance with us.

736
01:10:59.790 --> 01:11:01.280
Come on, let's dance.

737
01:11:15.460 --> 01:11:16.650
We...

738
01:11:17.830 --> 01:11:19.770
might not get to see each other as often

739
01:11:22.360 --> 01:11:25.760
and eventually go our own ways,

740
01:11:28.490 --> 01:11:30.370
each with stories of our own,

741
01:11:31.190 --> 01:11:32.620
but I want you to remember that...

742
01:11:32.640 --> 01:11:33.370
Khem,

743
01:11:33.980 --> 01:11:34.790
come over here.

744
01:11:34.820 --> 01:11:35.720
- Khem. - Khem.

745
01:11:35.740 --> 01:11:36.830
Daddy.

746
01:11:36.860 --> 01:11:37.720
Hurry.

747
01:11:37.950 --> 01:11:38.910
Come on, Khem.

748
01:11:39.030 --> 01:11:40.180
The song is almost over.

749
01:11:40.200 --> 01:11:41.130
Come on.

750
01:11:41.160 --> 01:11:43.900
I'll always be here for you.

751
01:11:52.210 --> 01:11:52.990
Come on.

752
01:12:04.400 --> 01:12:05.290
[FirstOne, Wannakorn Reungrat]

753
01:12:05.310 --> 01:12:09.220
♪ No matter what may come our way... ♪

754
01:12:09.240 --> 01:12:09.970
Oh?

755
01:12:10.690 --> 01:12:12.230
Why are you here in a spirit form?

756
01:12:13.180 --> 01:12:15.020
Haven't been whacked for so long.

757
01:12:15.190 --> 01:12:16.930
I'll count to three and run, okay?

758
01:12:16.960 --> 01:12:17.980
I haven't even counted yet.

759
01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:18.790
Mor Lam!

760
01:12:19.040 --> 01:12:19.560
Come on.

761
01:12:19.610 --> 01:12:20.830
Let's dance in front of the stage.

762
01:12:22.170 --> 01:12:24.550
Thank you, khob khun, kamsahamnida. Clear enough?

763
01:12:24.570 --> 01:12:25.520
[Tle, Matimun Sreeboonrueang]

764
01:12:25.550 --> 01:12:28.680
♪ Every moment spent with you ♪

765
01:12:28.700 --> 01:12:33.430
♪ Means more than anything could every do ♪

766
01:12:34.160 --> 01:12:38.410
Can I try it again to prove my hypothesis is right?

767
01:12:38.650 --> 01:12:39.620
We don't know each other at all.

768
01:12:39.650 --> 01:12:41.160
I really don't know him.

769
01:12:41.350 --> 01:12:42.300
I'm gay.

770
01:12:42.400 --> 01:12:44.910
[Keng, Harit Buayoi]

771
01:12:47.850 --> 01:12:49.440
Get a damp cloth.

772
01:12:49.870 --> 01:12:53.810
[Incanting]

773
01:12:54.250 --> 01:12:56.090
My face is up here.

774
01:13:00.200 --> 01:13:02.690
[Namping, Napatsakorn Pingmuang]

775
01:13:03.840 --> 01:13:05.090
My name is Khem.

776
01:13:06.070 --> 01:13:07.610
I live right across the hall.

777
01:13:07.850 --> 01:13:09.230
Okay, Peem.

778
01:13:09.510 --> 01:13:11.950
Knowing I don't have much time left,

779
01:13:11.980 --> 01:13:13.980
if I don't follow my heart now,

780
01:13:14.990 --> 01:13:16.310
I may never get another chance.

781
01:13:19.230 --> 01:13:25.390
♪ As long as your little finger's linked with mine, we'll stay ♪

782
01:13:25.410 --> 01:13:27.740
♪ No matter how many nights may fly, ♪

783
01:13:27.760 --> 01:13:30.190
♪ My love for you will never die ♪

784
01:13:30.220 --> 01:13:33.130
♪ Though no stars shine to testify, ♪

785
01:13:33.150 --> 01:13:36.170
♪ Our hearts know the reason why ♪

786
01:13:40.770 --> 01:13:42.470
- Hey, hey. - Hey, hey.

787
01:14:28.290 --> 01:14:30.630
My face must be worn out by now.

788
01:14:34.270 --> 01:14:35.560
Please let me keep staring.

789
01:14:37.790 --> 01:14:40.000
The kids went to bed early, after all.

790
01:14:42.640 --> 01:14:45.380
It's not every day we get some time alone.

791
01:14:52.100 --> 01:14:54.460
My heart is so full, Khem,

792
01:14:55.630 --> 01:14:58.720
that I get to be a dad to Suea and Singha...

793
01:15:05.020 --> 01:15:07.310
and a master to Jet and Charn.

794
01:15:13.350 --> 01:15:14.510
But right now,

795
01:15:18.000 --> 01:15:20.180
I'm just happy to be your Peem.

796
01:15:33.260 --> 01:15:34.440
Peem...

797
01:15:35.660 --> 01:15:37.360
Let me recharge on you.

798
01:15:59.840 --> 01:16:01.970
You're such a big baby, just like our kids.

799
01:16:08.910 --> 01:16:11.200
But I'm your only big baby.

800
01:16:17.450 --> 01:16:19.040
How about...

801
01:16:19.750 --> 01:16:22.720
I let you recharge as much as you want?

802
01:16:47.550 --> 01:16:50.260
You really gave quite a speech today

803
01:16:50.890 --> 01:16:52.720
while blessing Jet and Charn.

804
01:16:54.090 --> 01:16:56.070
Did you rehearse it beforehand?

805
01:16:58.230 --> 01:17:00.350
I was thinking about us.

806
01:17:03.050 --> 01:17:04.910
It took us quite a journey to get here.

807
01:17:17.830 --> 01:17:19.710
My face must be worn out by now.

808
01:17:20.170 --> 01:17:21.720
Please help me, Master.

809
01:17:22.190 --> 01:17:23.260
I'm begging you.

810
01:17:23.720 --> 01:17:26.700
Do you want me to break my promise to my grandfather for you?

811
01:17:27.050 --> 01:17:29.060
And stay out of my business.

812
01:17:29.090 --> 01:17:31.090
We're not that close.

813
01:17:31.860 --> 01:17:33.130
At first,

814
01:17:33.670 --> 01:17:35.840
you were really hard on me.

815
01:17:40.380 --> 01:17:41.790
You have no idea

816
01:17:42.410 --> 01:17:44.520
how much I had to fight myself.

817
01:17:47.800 --> 01:17:49.870
To become my disciple,

818
01:17:50.280 --> 01:17:52.520
you must honor me as your master

819
01:17:52.720 --> 01:17:54.540
without any disrespect, harm,

820
01:17:54.750 --> 01:17:56.730
or impure intentions.

821
01:17:57.190 --> 01:17:58.040
Well...

822
01:17:59.860 --> 01:18:01.760
should I thank Pong

823
01:18:02.780 --> 01:18:04.170
for making you make your move?

824
01:18:04.320 --> 01:18:06.170
Don't you bring him up.

825
01:18:08.180 --> 01:18:10.240
You look a bit down, Pong.

826
01:18:11.130 --> 01:18:13.210
I sense that you might get hurt.

827
01:18:14.310 --> 01:18:15.580
Make sure you pray more often.

828
01:18:16.890 --> 01:18:18.760
I should be thanking you

829
01:18:19.610 --> 01:18:20.960
for putting up with me.

830
01:18:21.250 --> 01:18:23.890
I'll do everything I can

831
01:18:24.090 --> 01:18:25.320
to stop being an outsider to you.

832
01:18:26.280 --> 01:18:27.820
I already knew

833
01:18:27.850 --> 01:18:29.950
that you were just mean on the outside.

834
01:18:31.200 --> 01:18:32.870
I wonder who it was

835
01:18:33.690 --> 01:18:36.460
that put bandages on me while I was asleep.

836
01:18:38.540 --> 01:18:40.380
I wonder who it was

837
01:18:40.940 --> 01:18:43.160
that cooked me a meal

838
01:18:44.700 --> 01:18:47.460
even though I told him he should give it to Dotty.

839
01:18:51.420 --> 01:18:52.710
Finished the whole plate?

840
01:18:53.020 --> 01:18:54.630
Didn't you say it was just okay?

841
01:18:55.510 --> 01:18:57.330
If it weren't for your power,

842
01:18:57.360 --> 01:18:59.200
things could've turned out much worse.

843
01:19:00.080 --> 01:19:01.360
It wasn't me.

844
01:19:02.630 --> 01:19:03.560
Wait...

845
01:19:03.960 --> 01:19:04.990
If it wasn't you...

846
01:19:05.010 --> 01:19:06.740
Stop pestering me, will you?

847
01:19:08.980 --> 01:19:10.350
If you want to stay, then stay.

848
01:19:10.400 --> 01:19:12.640
But don't force me into anything.

849
01:19:14.380 --> 01:19:16.300
It's impossible between us.

850
01:19:22.540 --> 01:19:24.210
Yet, somehow, it became possible.

851
01:19:25.890 --> 01:19:27.580
You asked for my help

852
01:19:27.710 --> 01:19:29.290
and are staying under my roof.

853
01:19:29.600 --> 01:19:31.670
That makes you mine.

854
01:19:32.350 --> 01:19:35.480
I intend to save you from this curse.

855
01:19:41.800 --> 01:19:43.910
Just having you here

856
01:19:44.130 --> 01:19:47.430
is more than enough for me.

857
01:19:50.090 --> 01:19:51.280
No matter when,

858
01:19:52.780 --> 01:19:55.880
my door will always be open to you.

859
01:19:56.400 --> 01:19:57.560
I'm back.

860
01:19:58.900 --> 01:19:59.980
Have you been waiting long?

861
01:20:02.270 --> 01:20:04.620
I want you to spend the rest of your life

862
01:20:05.210 --> 01:20:06.960
with me.

863
01:20:07.770 --> 01:20:09.800
Thank you so much, Khem,

864
01:20:12.380 --> 01:20:13.860
for staying by my side

865
01:20:15.320 --> 01:20:17.150
when I had no one left.

866
01:20:22.300 --> 01:20:23.360
Peem,

867
01:20:25.150 --> 01:20:27.200
you've spent your whole life carrying others.

868
01:20:28.960 --> 01:20:30.800
But now that I'm right here,

869
01:20:31.890 --> 01:20:33.820
let me carry you for a change.

870
01:20:52.680 --> 01:20:53.980
Don't tell me...

871
01:20:55.020 --> 01:20:56.090
Carry me.

872
01:20:57.740 --> 01:20:58.760
I want to be in bed now.

873
01:20:58.790 --> 01:21:04.340
♪ I wonder what led our paths to intertwine ♪

874
01:21:04.360 --> 01:21:09.590
♪ Was it fate or something divine? ♪

875
01:21:09.610 --> 01:21:10.750
I'm not going.

876
01:21:11.470 --> 01:21:13.200
Come on.

877
01:21:13.420 --> 01:21:14.560
Peem!

878
01:21:15.670 --> 01:21:22.000
♪ An eternal thread weaving your soul to mine ♪

879
01:21:22.550 --> 01:21:29.550
♪ My heart entwined with yours through lows and highs, ♪

880
01:21:33.740 --> 01:21:40.740
♪ And it still beats for you as countless years go by ♪

881
01:21:40.830 --> 01:21:42.120
You're good at giving massages.

882
01:21:49.820 --> 01:21:51.540
Is there anything else we're missing?

883
01:21:57.200 --> 01:22:00.930
Is there anything I haven't given you yet?

884
01:22:06.160 --> 01:22:07.220
Peem,

885
01:22:08.690 --> 01:22:10.770
I have a home, a car,

886
01:22:10.800 --> 01:22:13.130
and such a loving family.

887
01:22:14.110 --> 01:22:15.830
What more could I possibly want?

888
01:22:25.790 --> 01:22:26.920
Honestly,

889
01:22:29.400 --> 01:22:32.560
I never expected to live past 21.

890
01:22:34.680 --> 01:22:36.880
Everything after that is a bonus.

891
01:22:40.750 --> 01:22:41.840
And...

892
01:22:43.040 --> 01:22:45.930
you've given me more than I ever dreamed of.

893
01:22:52.030 --> 01:22:53.880
There's nothing else I want.

894
01:22:56.960 --> 01:22:58.720
I just want to grow old with you,

895
01:23:02.560 --> 01:23:04.600
see how I change over the years,

896
01:23:06.700 --> 01:23:09.980
and watch my friends and everyone live their lives.

897
01:23:12.220 --> 01:23:14.170
That's all I need to be happy.

898
01:23:26.690 --> 01:23:29.690
I kind of want to see you with our grandkids.

899
01:23:34.170 --> 01:23:37.380
I can't wait to see you as a grandfather as well.

900
01:23:39.200 --> 01:23:39.920
Wait,

901
01:23:41.410 --> 01:23:43.500
you already look the part, don't you?

902
01:23:53.660 --> 01:23:59.000
Have I told you I love you today?

903
01:24:05.150 --> 01:24:06.860
You haven't.

904
01:24:08.070 --> 01:24:10.290
Let me hear it.

905
01:24:17.020 --> 01:24:19.740
I love you so much.

906
01:24:21.340 --> 01:24:24.120
More than anything in the world.

907
01:24:26.560 --> 01:24:28.900
And I'll love you in every lifetime.

908
01:24:37.830 --> 01:24:40.280
I love you, too.

909
01:24:43.690 --> 01:24:45.140
More than anything in the world.

910
01:24:50.810 --> 01:24:51.760
So,

911
01:24:53.590 --> 01:24:57.310
can I recharge on you as much as I want, too?

912
01:24:59.780 --> 01:25:00.860
Please?

913
01:25:02.810 --> 01:25:08.500
♪ For no other love could ever feel as true ♪

914
01:25:09.860 --> 01:25:16.760
♪ My heart entwined with yours through lows and highs, ♪

915
01:25:20.990 --> 01:25:27.990
♪ And it still beats for you as countless years go by ♪

916
01:25:28.960 --> 01:25:34.920
♪ I'm certain our paths were meant to align ♪

917
01:25:34.940 --> 01:25:40.180
♪ Fate brought you here to stand by my side ♪

918
01:25:40.200 --> 01:25:46.040
♪ And bound our love to last till the end of time ♪

919
